Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:07:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] AI_AB_TEST: flag CoalitionPact (defensive pacts against a
 shared warmonger threat)

From the Diplomacy audit's map: defensive pacts were only made with
existing friends and their score had no term for a common threat, so they
never formed against a conqueror on purpose. With the flag, a civ that
shares a SEVERE or CRITICAL warmonger threat with us (it has denounced the
warmonger, lost a city to it, or lives close to it; never its friends or
pact partners) is a pact candidate even without a friendship, and a pact
scores +40 per shared threat (up to two). The usual checks still apply
(IsGoodChoiceForDefensivePact, the pact limit, both sides must want it).

IsVisiblyAgainstWarmonger is now the shared test for CoalitionCoop and
CoalitionPact.

Left out of the bundle until tested (bully and builders tests).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj1hm6um5X9SZaXQCRZ
